    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8c79aca10c0069e36e33",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "eddie",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8c79aca10c0069e36e33",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Per yesterday's review of orphaned issues, I took a quick look at this:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "SPARQL query: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "ASK { <info:fedora/fedora-system:ServiceDefinition-3.0> <dc:identifier> \"fedora-system:ServiceDefinition-3.0\" }",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Result:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<sparql xmlns=\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/DataAccess/rf1/result"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/DataAccess/rf1/result",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": "\">",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<head>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<variable name=\"k0\"/>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "</head>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<results>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<result>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<k0 datatype=\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": "\">true</k0>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "</result>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "</results>",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "</sparql>",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "So, it's correctly returning true, but the response format is not SPARQL Query Results XML Format (",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-sparql-XMLres/),"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-sparql-XMLres/),",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " see: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-1023#icft=FCREPO-1023"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Going to close this issue, although I'm not sure what the correct fix version is. Looks like it was addressed 4 years ago in Mulgara: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://code.mulgara.org/issues/113"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://code.mulgara.org/issues/113",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
