     "body": "<p>Per yesterday's review of orphaned issues, I took a quick look at this:</p>\n\n<p>SPARQL query: <br/>\nASK </p>\n{ &lt;info:fedora/fedora-system:ServiceDefinition-3.0&gt; &lt;dc:identifier&gt; \"fedora-system:ServiceDefinition-3.0\" }\n\n<p>Result:<br/>\n&lt;sparql xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/DataAccess/rf1/result\"&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;head&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;variable name=\"k0\"/&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/head&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;results&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;result&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;k0 datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean\"&gt;true&lt;/k0&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;/result&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/results&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/sparql&gt;</p>\n\n<p>So, it's correctly returning true, but the response format is not SPARQL Query Results XML Format (<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-sparql-XMLres/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-sparql-XMLres/</a>), see: \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-1023\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-1023\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"No Support for Latest W3C SPARQL Query Results XML Format\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-1023\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>Going to close this issue, although I'm not sure what the correct fix version is. Looks like it was addressed 4 years ago in Mulgara: <a href=\"http://code.mulgara.org/issues/113\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://code.mulgara.org/issues/113</a></p>",
     "created": "24/Aug/12 7:11 AM",
